Eigen 3.4.0 vendored for DiskRange

Source: Eigen 3.4.0 (header-only), copied from a system libeigen3-dev install.

Version: Eigen 3.4.0 (EIGEN_WORLD_VERSION 3 / EIGEN_MAJOR_VERSION 4 /
EIGEN_MINOR_VERSION 0).

Use in this repository: header-only dependency for lib/PcaFit.h, specifically
Eigen::JacobiSVD<Eigen::MatrixXd> used by the PCA enclosing-ball prune.

License / provenance files:
- COPYING.MPL2: Mozilla Public License 2.0 text.
- COPYRIGHT.Debian: Debian libeigen3-dev copyright metadata.

The full Eigen include tree was vendored to avoid manually curating nested
header dependencies. See THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md for the project-level summary.
